{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29080","headline":"自楞伽寺晨起泛舟道中有怀 · 许浑","name":"自楞伽寺晨起泛舟道中有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧树苍苍茂苑东，佳期迢遰路何穷。\n一声山鸟曙云外，万点水萤秋草中。\n门掩竹斋微有月，棹移兰渚淡无风。\n欲知此路堪惆怅，菱叶蓼花连故宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}